The key message for HSBC

> We already have the conversations. We already have Microsoft 365 and SharePoint. We already have the recordings and transcripts. The opportunity is to add an intelligent knowledge-engineering layer that converts those conversations into structured, governed and reusable enterprise knowledge.



And the most important design decision is to start small and measurable:

> Microsoft Stream → Agent 1 → Human Validation → Agent 2 → GAIP



Then progressively introduce the Knowledge Graph and Agent 3 metadata/context enrichment as the GAIP retrieval and metadata-filtering capabilities mature.

This makes the initiative practical today while creating a strong foundation for a much broader enterprise knowledge fabric tomorrow.
